{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"vanitied-kitschy-mantis","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nFiled from the escape analysis on marshy-chummy-coot (2399-5e49-6b28-4d59). An instrumented test run (pytest plugin hard-wiring BindingStore.is_comment_mapped to False on every loaded module copy) showed the pre-fix dedup test suite could not observe the primary skip being disabled end-to-end: the differ tests seed map state via a private _StubBindingStore (tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_comment_id_map_diff.py), while the apply tests seed synthetic id-bearing payloads. Each layer's test seeds the invariant the other layer is supposed to establish; no test crosses the seam.\n\n## Proposal (test work; operator to adjudicate priority)\nAdd one seam-crossing dedup test: drive the real apply-phase recording (_record_comment_id path) with the transport's REAL envelope shape (the ACLI batch-mutation fixture added by fix 8d98c298fa8 in test_comment_id_acli_envelope.py), against a real BindingStore instance, then run _diff_comments against that SAME store and assert the already-posted comment is skipped. A control variant asserts a not-yet-posted comment is NOT skipped.\n\nDistinct from crusty-brinish-ass (3235-8aaf-e288-48f2), which covers fixture provenance for the transport passthrough seam. This ticket tests the apply-to-differ seam using that fixture.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Test posts via the real recording path with the real envelope fixture and re-diffs against the same store instance\n- [ ] Assert skip engages for the recorded comment and does not engage for an unrecorded one\n- [ ] Test fails if is_comment_mapped is inert (verified by temporarily disabling the guard)\n\n## Non-goals\nNo new review criterion; no changes to production code.","id":"9dc3-7d6c-83d7-41c7","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Seam-crossing dedup test: real envelope through record then re-diff same store"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787397437256325001,"uuid":"cd25dbfb-461c-4142-a189-db11451be80b"}